---
// BrandStory.astro - Tanishq-style Atelier Heritage & Trust Narrative
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#FAF6EF]/60 relative border-t border-[#E5D8C3]">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Ornamental Motif -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#8C6D37] font-semibold">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C5A869]"></span>
        <span>The Satvastones Atelier</span>
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C5A869]"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="ornamental-divider">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rotate-45 border border-[#C5A869] inline-block"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Regal Editorial Imagery Duo with Gold Framing -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 relative">
        <!-- Background Decorative Arch Line -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 border border-[#C5A869]/20 rounded-sm pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
        
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-t-[80px] rounded-b-xs overflow-hidden bg-[#FAF6EF] border border-[#E5D8C3] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(42,24,16,0.08)] transform translate-y-3">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599643478518-a784e5dc4c8f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Satvastones fine jewellery worn on collarbone"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-t-[80px] rounded-b-xs overflow-hidden bg-[#FAF6EF] border border-[#E5D8C3] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(42,24,16,0.08)] transform -translate-y-3">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611591475152-47eac9c5bdfa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Macro details of 18K gold PVD coated chains"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Narrative with Royal Indian Fine Jewellery Tone -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#8C6D37] font-semibold">
          Honest Indian Craftsmanship
        </span>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-[#2A1810] font-normal leading-[1.14]">
          More than jewellery. A little expression of you.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6B5E55] leading-relaxed font-light">
          <p>
            Rooted in our store location in <strong>Vapi (Gujarat)</strong>, Satvastones Jewellery was conceived with a clear principle: fine, water-resistant luxury should not be locked in lockers for special weddings alone, nor should everyday pieces rust, peel, or turn green on Indian skin.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not make false marketing promises that our pieces are invincible or will stay forever untouched under harsh abrasive chemicals. But we take immense pride that <strong>the quality of our products is exceptionally good</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            By fusing medical-grade 316L stainless steel with real 18K gold through vacuum Physical Vapor Deposition (PVD), every design is built for the rhythm of your daily life—showers, workouts, monsoons, and daily desk rituals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Proprietor & Atelier Seal -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5D8C3] flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="font-serif text-sm font-medium text-[#2A1810]">Anirudh A Verma</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#8C6D37] tracking-wider uppercase">Proprietor • Satvastones Jewellery, Chala, Vapi (396191)</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-[#2A1810] hover:text-[#C5A869] transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Our Story</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
